<div class="page-head"><div><h1>Add a service to an existing gateway</h1><p class="lede">A service on a gateway that already runs (a new service usually gets its own gateway: <a href="/services/new">Add service</a>). Its allow-list (policy rules) decides who may reach it; the default is deny. Creating it does not touch the name server — deploy the rendered policy and restart the gateway to make it live.</p></div></div>
